# modules/auth

- Onboarding invite ticket/access status, auth callback debug helpers.
- Connectivity helpers: `infra/auth/**`, email: `infra/email/resend-api.ts`.
- Shim: `src/lib/onboarding*`, `src/lib/auth-callback-debug*` → edit `modules/auth/`.
- Routes stay in `src/app/(auth)/**`; actions: `src/actions/auth.ts`, `invite.ts`, `onboarding-entry.ts`.
- Invites: Resend only — do not switch to Supabase invite mail.
